                <pb facs="0659" n="1289" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v2/pg1289"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-chapter-head">[Hamburg]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-volume-rules" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1873-12-01T23:59:59-04:56"
                            notBefore="1873-01-01T00:00:00-04:56">undated</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Aliens can become naturalized after six months’ residence on payment of a small
                    fee. The law of Hamburg is said to recognize a double allegiance in persons
                    thus, naturalized, and does not require any renunciation of native
                        allegiance.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d213-f1"/></p>
            </div>
        </body>
